      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The symptoms and signs help to diagnose an immune-mediated disorder of the conjunctiva in the general practice. Allergic rhino-conjunctivitis is the most common encountered disease and the management is discussed. The non ophthalmologist should be cautious in cases of severe atopia, involvement of the cornea and suspicion of corneal infection."},
